This product bundles WinDivert (WinDivert.dll, WinDivert64.sys, and its import
library and headers under vendor/), which is a separate work licensed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License v3 (with a dual GPL/proprietary option).
Throttle links to WinDivert dynamically and ships it as a separate, replaceable
component; it is not statically linked into the Throttle binary. See
vendor/WinDivert-2.2.2-A/LICENSE for its full terms.
